rtant;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          风味：花香，橘子，绿苹果，蜂蜜甜，红糖尾韵\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Floral, Tangerine, Green apple, Honeyed sweet, Brown sugar finish\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCcTqPiaCB9OxiaaqAtrvrJAibq6RgZONK8Hdg7ntuMtEsJjribBkX065gEG4Wd4NWLQlBXM2w6LtV7Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Macora\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Macora庄园（全名 Santa Maria Macora)位于秘鲁中部Huanuco区域下的Marias区，Chipaquillo中心，海拔1459米；2004年，Clomalda女士和她的家人决定搬到Macora村，以获得更好的机会，提高他们的生活质量。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RHQNAatW1rnDqhFZianvsGEcfCRLaXe02SN440o9gZSQumV4mHkcGujicHmrWLahQZtvWOnfSQ0DSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Clomalda说到，因为种植Coca的必要性和紧迫性，为了急于获得资金，但也看到了它在我们的生活中产生的负面影响，所以决定在2008年改种咖啡（当时品种是Typica和Caturra），种植面积为1公顷。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          由于所在的区域的天气和地理很适合种植咖啡，联合国也有相应的扶持项目，在这样的支持下，到现在我们从1公顷的种植面积扩大到3公顷，种植品种也有了新的增加，现在种植卡杜拉，卡蒂姆以及瑰夏（瑰夏自2017年开始种植，有近1公顷）。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，欢迎关注小程序或者淘宝店铺 “有容乃大”\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 408px;height: 173px;\"/>\n</p>\n</div>",
